# 8. Ejemplos de prompts buenos

## 8.1 Crear plan sin tocar código
```text
Read AGENTS.md and docs/specs/004-auth-refresh/spec.md. Propose a short implementation plan. Do not modify code yet.
```

## 8.2 Implementar con cambios mínimos
```text
Implement docs/specs/004-auth-refresh/spec.md following repository instructions. Preserve architecture, keep diffs minimal, and summarize the changed files and validation steps.
```

## 8.3 Corregir bug
```text
Investigate the failing auth refresh flow. Read AGENTS.md, identify root cause first, then apply the smallest safe fix and explain validation steps.
```

## 8.4 Mejorar tests
```text
Review the tests related to auth refresh. Add only the missing tests needed to validate the spec, keeping the suite deterministic and readable.
```

## 8.5 Revisar PR
```text
Review this change against docs/specs/004-auth-refresh/spec.md and AGENTS.md. Identify architecture, naming, validation, and risk issues.
```

